<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 900 640" width="900" height="640" font-family="Segoe UI, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif">
  <rect width="900" height="640" fill="#ffffff"/>
  <text x="20" y="24" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#111">Corrida reproduzida: 6 uploads aceitos no mesmo segundo (16:15:53,54x)</text>
  <text x="20" y="42" font-size="11" fill="#666">Evidência: docs/evidence/14-burst-8.txt e 18-zip-contaminacao.txt</text>

  <rect x="26" y="60" width="150" height="40" rx="4" fill="#eef3ff" stroke="#2c5aa0"/>
  <text x="101" y="78" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">REQ2..REQ5</text>
  <text x="101" y="93" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" fill="#445">short 12 s</text>
  <line x1="101" y1="100" x2="101" y2="600" stroke="#bbb" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>

  <rect x="196" y="60" width="150" height="40" rx="4" fill="#eef3ff" stroke="#2c5aa0"/>
  <text x="271" y="78" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">REQ6 / REQ7</text>
  <text x="271" y="93" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" fill="#445">long 40 s</text>
  <line x1="271" y1="100" x2="271" y2="600" stroke="#bbb" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>

  <rect x="386" y="60" width="150" height="40" rx="4" fill="#ffe8e8" stroke="#c0392b"/>
  <text x="461" y="78" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Gin</text>
  <text x="461" y="93" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" fill="#633">handleVideoUpload</text>
  <line x1="461" y1="100" x2="461" y2="600" stroke="#bbb" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>

  <rect x="576" y="60" width="130" height="40" rx="4" fill="#f2f2f2" stroke="#666"/>
  <text x="641" y="84" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">FFmpeg</text>
  <line x1="641" y1="100" x2="641" y2="600" stroke="#bbb" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>

  <rect x="746" y="60" width="140" height="40" rx="4" fill="#fff6e5" stroke="#b8860b"/>
  <text x="816" y="78" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">temp/20260919_</text>
  <text x="816" y="92" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">161553/</text>
  <line x1="816" y1="100" x2="816" y2="600" stroke="#bbb" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>

  <line x1="101" y1="124" x2="455" y2="124" stroke="#2c5aa0" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <line x1="271" y1="140" x2="455" y2="140" stroke="#2c5aa0" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <text x="120" y="118" font-size="10" fill="#2c5aa0">POST /upload (x6, mesmo instante)</text>

  <rect x="330" y="152" width="270" height="34" rx="3" fill="#fff9d9" stroke="#b8860b"/>
  <text x="465" y="167" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" fill="#5a4200">timestamp := time.Now().Format("20060102_150405")</text>
  <text x="465" y="180" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b2500">mesmo valor para os 6: 20260919_161553</text>

  <line x1="461" y1="204" x2="810" y2="204" stroke="#b8860b" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <text x="560" y="198" font-size="10" fill="#8a6508">MkdirAll: um único diretório para os 6 requests</text>

  <line x1="461" y1="230" x2="635" y2="230" stroke="#666" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <text x="470" y="224" font-size="10" fill="#555">ffmpeg -vf fps=1 gera frame_%04d.png</text>
  <line x1="641" y1="252" x2="810" y2="252" stroke="#666" stroke-width="1.3" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <text x="650" y="246" font-size="10" fill="#555">grava frame_0001..0012 (short)</text>
  <line x1="641" y1="272" x2="810" y2="272" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="1.3" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <text x="650" y="266" font-size="10" fill="#c0392b">grava frame_0001..0040 (long) e sobrescreve</text>

  <line x1="810" y1="298" x2="467" y2="298" stroke="#b8860b" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <text x="500" y="292" font-size="10" fill="#8a6508">Glob("temp/.../*.png") devolve 24 arquivos</text>

  <rect x="300" y="310" width="380" height="46" rx="3" fill="#ffd9d9" stroke="#8b0000" stroke-width="1.4"/>
  <text x="490" y="327" font-size="10.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b0000">REQ5 enviou um vídeo de 12 s e recebeu 24 frames</text>
  <text x="490" y="343" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" fill="#5a1010">frame_0013..0024 pertencem ao vídeo de outro upload: vazamento entre requisições</text>

  <line x1="461" y1="378" x2="810" y2="378" stroke="#b8860b" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <text x="500" y="372" font-size="10" fill="#8a6508">cria outputs/frames_20260919_161553.zip (nome também compartilhado)</text>

  <line x1="461" y1="412" x2="810" y2="412" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <text x="500" y="406" font-size="10.5" font-weight="700" fill="#c0392b">defer os.RemoveAll(temp/...) apaga a pasta enquanto os outros ainda escrevem</text>

  <line x1="810" y1="440" x2="647" y2="440" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <text x="560" y="434" font-size="10" fill="#c0392b">frame_0030.png: I/O error</text>
  <rect x="470" y="450" width="410" height="34" rx="3" fill="#ffe8e8" stroke="#c0392b"/>
  <text x="675" y="465" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b0000">"Could not open file" · "Error muxing a packet" · Conversion failed!</text>
  <text x="675" y="478" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b0000">ffmpeg exit status 251</text>

  <line x1="455" y1="508" x2="107" y2="508" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 3" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <text x="120" y="502" font-size="10" fill="#c0392b">HTTP 200 · success=false · "open temp/.../frame_0019.png: no such file or directory"</text>
  <line x1="455" y1="532" x2="277" y2="532" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 3" marker-end="url(#a2)"/>
  <text x="120" y="526" font-size="10" fill="#c0392b">HTTP 200 · success=false · "Erro no ffmpeg: exit status 251" e stderr completo</text>

  <rect x="26" y="552" width="854" height="70" rx="5" fill="#fafafa" stroke="#888"/>
  <text x="40" y="572" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700" fill="#111">Resultado da rajada de 8 uploads simultâneos</text>
  <text x="40" y="590" font-size="10.5" fill="#333">3 ZIPs gerados para 8 uploads · 5 requisições perderam o trabalho (62,5%) · 1 dos 3 ZIPs está contaminado com frames alheios</text>
  <text x="40" y="606" font-size="10.5" fill="#333">Todas as 8 responderam HTTP 200 · nenhum job registrado como FAILED · o cliente que recebeu o ZIP corrompido não tem como saber</text>
  <text x="40" y="618" font-size="10" fill="#666">Latência: requisições isoladas 0,86 a 1,28 s; dentro da rajada 4,03 a 4,25 s (degradação de cerca de 4x por contenção de CPU)</text>

  <defs>
    <marker id="a2" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#555"/>
    </marker>
  </defs>
</svg>
